aristotle-ethics-2.logic.r1: argue/scope: P4 (S3): read with the obligation on its consequent alone, greater_exceeds_mean ∧ mean_exceeds_less → O(add_to_less ∧ take_from_greater), the argument holds; read with it on the whole conditional, O(greater_exceeds_mean ∧ mean_exceeds_less → add_to_less ∧ take_from_greater), C (S4) does not follow: it needs the ought on the consequent alone (narrow scope), not only on the conditional (wide), and which the sentence means decides the argument
